<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	Hardened runtime with no exceptions, on purpose. Checked against the binary:
	- No JIT: GPUI draws with Metal (shaders compile out of process through the system Metal compiler) and the
	  wry webview is WKWebView, whose JavaScriptCore runs in Apple's own WebContent process, not ours.
	- No disable-library-validation: the binary links only system frameworks/dylibs and loads no plug-ins.
	- Not sandboxed, so no network/file entitlements are needed.
	Add a key here only when a notarized build is seen to crash without it, and say why.
	-->
</dict>
</plist>
